WEBVTT

01:01:30.636 --> 01:01:32.679
Back, back.

01:01:32.764 --> 01:01:34.514
Down, down!

01:01:35.183 --> 01:01:37.267
Okay, what do I do?
Come on, Woody. Think.

01:01:40.646 --> 01:01:41.646
Guys!

01:01:43.358 --> 01:01:45.901
No, no, no, no! Wait!
Wait. Listen, please.

01:01:45.985 --> 01:01:47.319
There's a good toy down there,

01:01:47.403 --> 01:01:50.530
and he's gonna be blown
to bits in a few minutes.

01:01:50.615 --> 01:01:54.159
All because of me.
We gotta save him.

01:01:54.243 --> 01:01:56.995
And...
But I need your help.
